  // Consent mode. Every visit starts with PostHog quiet: no cookies, no
  // events, no recording. The banner at the bottom of the page saves the
  // visitor's choice in localStorage ("w3f_consent") and applies it:
  // Accept turns on full tracking and session replay; Decline keeps PostHog
